成任何好事都是不可能的。所以我很高兴这些领导人能够进行接触，这定下了基调并搭建了一个平台，打下了一个基础；希望在此之上，外交和贸易谈判的艰苦工作能够得以推进，最终始终造福于美国人民——我想也可以说，造福于世界。谢谢！”","tg":{"media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/fa08e3aaa4.mp4?token=LrGy5w3OVzr6WbFosWS__aRMzF4QLgYipkuABwZ66sr57Xk3eQ3FJ25CESOTyQBFkRCi2pOS8uq6UJyiuz7EEhx9joqh0SiUxN_W6r4OaCVZmXRvLNLjEOyFIlkaamMAX3lHJ3dYcU9WKeReapdRV41niTko6zB0LPuVcXMHkpnU8ZKzMiSXaKxzlOjBuwr-qVwQaK8EP9qEj7fIN7O_SjDrFGO80KT0Tf2fDUpxYyaT9NR51q87pOXCcE87ALPCsQuxKoAFqoPWarrGv46IOyY1ru_TX3t1SYSpREP1rrXod5O8-CFtAmRDuj7z1GjsB7RNOHeLHD6wNX1POgatrA","preview_url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/IGPSXp_uBEyVXu4BuGMeKCw8iFDjj9MaBfABwfBhVaMeZL9iYq1DqNBrAddQwMRlzV9sMI6SSAtz6583UajC0WjJxZNfSEL8gf7fogcQGb9F85weZK0NJvVO84CL3l5P5hU_TRYVhl844_5EYRNJEb2x1RhzkJOwtM9wOhgWTpzwJ6p9GNl-nVw7DqLAw6nCB2eCynZTAyJRmebFCZ8Z2jBJvJBi0Gz5DJKCQNx2IJjTFj5bRmDJgmfIdbxAMjOFY2LUNjv-UOjPFbfnrJ-mxgenj0UfwNYIXH9ZYMc7siQdN4tRxcMwRsnqe6dUI1K0qqGAdzR6O__z0UyW1X40MQ"}],"views":1400,"views_label":"1.4K","reactions":[{"emoji":"👍","count":22,"label":"22"},{"emoji":"🤡","count":6,"label":"6"},{"emoji":"❤","count":3,"label":"3"},{"emoji":"👏","count":3,"label":"3"},{"emoji":"🥰","count":1,"label":"1"},{"emoji":"🤣","count":1,"label":"1"}],"fetched_at":"2026-11-23T10:06:31+08:00"}},{"id":"freechinese:113491","kind":"news","channel":"current","source_id":"freechinese","source_name":"FREE 中文","title":"记者：你说普京是你的朋友，俄罗斯是伊朗最大的盟友。你认为普京是美国的朋友吗？","summary":"特朗普：我无法代表美国发言，我认为我和普京的关系非常好。","url":"https://t.me/freechinese/113491","image":{"url":"media/freechinese/113491_1.webp","width":320,"height":180},"published_at":"2026-11-21T14:03:10+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-23T10:09:02+08:00","lang":"zh","translated":false,"body":"记者：你说普京是你的朋友，俄罗斯是伊朗最大的盟友。你认为普京是美国的朋友吗？\n\n特朗普：我无法代表美国发言，我认为我和普京的关系非常好。","tg":{"media":[{"type":"video","url":"https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/ae492b05c4.mp4?token=TR4sRURgMoHcbajJGdHttX09n_-5x0t9kB2QPi4ygEMYqqPk7OT3zkfVR9h-viDJ98uM4cYPoM9VP7h-iNXbRHkw6YyOZx8nl7NrlJQv288DKkaelkoM0oz3PwhJRmxpWTNRcDVaQlcNB_UZvNOKQiRBocjifSA